                                        <div class="br-platform-desc">In TradingView, click the "Trading Panel" button at the bottom of the chart. Select your broker from the list of supported brokers, log in with your broker credentials, and your account balance and positions will appear directly in TradingView. You can then place, modify, and close trades from the chart.</div>
