                                        <div class="br-platform-desc">If your broker doesn't support TradingView integration, you can still use TradingView for analysis and set Pine Script alerts that trigger webhook notifications to third-party automation services (e.g., 3Commas, Autoview, or custom MT4 bridge EAs). This lets TradingView signal entry/exit and MT4/MT5 execute the trade automatically.</div>
